<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks rose, six fell and two were flat in 12.3-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 0.7 percent to 146 zlotys in a 21.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>- - Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
